    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are proud to present 1 South Circular Road, Portobello, Dublin 8, D08 K0E2 to the market. A most impressive and attractive end of terrace bay-windowed red-brick period residence c. 260 sq. m. / 2798 sq. ft. with development potential subject to planning\r\n\r\nStanding on a large corner site, south-facing to rear with large garage/store 73 sq. m./786 sq. ft. with vehicular access to Kingsland Lane. Carefully maintained throughout with fine original features including mantlepieces, ceiling cornice, timber floors, etc.\r\n\r\nElegantly proportioned, full of light and extended to side.\r\n\r\nComprising Hall with ceiling cornice and centre rose, mosaic tiled floor. There are two reception rooms with marble mantlepieces, ceiling cornice and centre roses, folding doors.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor return, Bedroom 1 has a cast-iron mantlepiece, W.C.. On the first floor, Bedroom 2 (front) has a marble mantlepiece. Bedroom 3 (front) has a marble mantlepiece and bay window. Bedroom 4 (rear) has a marble mantlepiece. There is a showerroom with shower, W.C., WHB.\r\n\r\nAt garden level with separate entrance is a hall, study, living room with marble mantlepiece, kitchen with a range of units and to the side two further rooms ideally suited to bedrooms or studies. On the return is a bathroom and an additional room which could be used as a bedroom/study. \r\n\r\nOutside is a front garden, south-facing rear garden, large garage/store with vehicular access to Kingsland Lane.\r\n\r\nMuch sought-after location beside schools, bus routes, LUAS. Beside cafes, restaurants, shops, and within walking distance of Dublin 2 and city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall level\r\nEntrance Hall \r\nCeiling cornice and centre rose. Dado rail. Mosaic tiled floor.\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece with gas fire. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. Bay window. Stained timber floor. Folding doors to\r\nLivingroom\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast-iron insert. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. 2x windows to rear.\r\n1st Floor Return\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCast-iron mantlepiece, ceiling cornice. W.C.\r\n1st Floor\r\nBedroom 2 (front)\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast-iron insert, ceiling cornice.\r\nBedroom 3 (front)\r\nMarble mantlepiece with brick insert, ceiling cornice and centre rose. Bay window.\r\nBedroom 4 (rear)\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast-iron insert. Ceiling cornice.\r\nShowerroom\r\nShower, W.C., WHB, access to attic. Dado rail. Tiled floor.\r\nGarden level\r\nSeparate entrance.\r\nHall\r\nUndersteps storage.\r\nStudy\r\n\r\nLiving room\r\nMarble mantlepiece with tiled insert, gas line. Ceiling cornice, bay window.\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of wall and floor units. 1 1/3 sink unit extractor. Part tiled. Plumbed for washing machine. Hob pen. 2x windows to rear.\r\nBedroom /study\r\nTo side.\r\nBedroom /study\r\nTo side.\r\nReturn\r\nBathroom\r\nBath with shower attachment, W.C., WHB, shower. Tiled.\r\nBedroom / Study \r\nOutside\r\nRailed and hedged front garden. Tiled and paved. South-facing rear garden with patio area, paved low maintenance garden. Outhouse. Boiler house, W.C. Garage/store 15.5 x 4.7 with vehicular access to Kingsland Lane."
      },
